msgstr "For Readers"

msgid "plugins.themes.spupLightExplorerTheme.about.readersCopy"
msgstr "Readers can browse journals, search across the network, access recent publications, read announcements, and continue to individual journal issues and archives."

msgid "plugins.themes.spupLightExplorerTheme.about.authors"
msgstr "For Authors"

msgid "plugins.themes.spupLightExplorerTheme.about.authorsCopy"
msgstr "Authors should identify the appropriate journal, review its aims and scope, read the Author Guidelines and publication and ethics policies, then submit directly through the selected journal."

