msgid "plugins.themes.spupLightExplorerTheme.about.platformCopy"
msgstr "The Light Explorer operates using Open Journal Systems (OJS), an open-source scholarly publishing platform developed by the Public Knowledge Project (PKP). OJS supports journal publishing workflows, archives, editorial activities, user accounts, and access to published scholarly content."

